AryaCode changes relative to the upstream project:

- Removed all cloud image providers (Google Gemini, OpenAI, OpenAI-compatible
  relays, ByteDance Seedream, Alibaba DashScope, xAI Grok, Zhipu GLM) and the
  subscription sign-in channels (ChatGPT, Grok, Google).
- Removed the credential/API-key management UI and server code.
- Reduced the provider set to a local ComfyUI server and its imported
  API-format workflows.
- Added local ComfyUI server lifecycle controls (start, stop, restart, status,
  optional auto-start) and a settings card for them.
- Added ComfyUI workflow support to the Studio workbench, the infinite canvas,
  and workflow-vs-workflow comparison.
- Converted all user-facing strings, documentation, and bundled inspiration
  content to English.
- Renamed the package to dsh-arya-image-gen and rebranded it for AryaCode.

